<p>Pardes Hai Muslim Hai Aur Lashkar E Aada Hai.</p>

<p>Koofe Me Taney Tanha Hyder Ka Dulaara Hai.</p>

<p>1. Jaae.n Tow Kaha.n Muslim Har Simte Sitamgar Hai.</p>

<p>Hyder Ke Bhatijey Par Kia Waqt Ye Aaya Hai.</p>

<p>2. Jaise Hi Salaam Aaya Shabbir Ko Bhai Ka.</p>

<p>Aansoo.n Ka Ek Dariya Aankho Se Bahaya Hai.</p>

<p>3. Afsos Ke Zaalim Ne Sar Kaatke Muslim Ka.</p>

<p>Muslim Ka Taney Athar Kothey Se Giraya Hai.</p>

<p>4. Letey Hain Shahe Dee.n Ab Godhi Me Ruqayya Ko.</p>

<p>Kehte Hain Ke Ae Beti Maara Gaya Baba Hai.</p>

<p>5. Galiyon Me Phiraate Hain Muslim Ke Janaaze Ko.</p>

<p>Aur Saath Janaaze Ke Sar Peethti Zahra Hai.</p>

<p>6. Aarif Bhi Bohot Royaa Ye Darde Baya.n Kahke.</p>

<p>Muslim Ki Shahadat Se Aghaaz Ghamo Ka Hai.</p>

<p>
(Mohammed Ali Arif)<br>
(Anjuuman E Asghari / Qayam Nagar)</p>